1.2 Chosen Specialized Technology

The chosen specialized area for this project is User Experience (UX) Design, focusing on improving the usability and navigation 
of the existing UiTM uFuture platform. UX design aims to create interfaces that are easy to understand and use.
This project proposes a new Academic Dashboard and improvements to the My Courses, Assignment, and Attendance pages. 
The proposed interfaces will be designed using Figma, a UI/UX design and prototyping tool. 
An interactive prototype will be developed to demonstrate clearer assignment deadlines, task priority indicators, attendance summaries, 
and improved navigation without modifying the existing uFuture system.
